# 📋 Overview

**New-Hire Onboarding Concierge** is an enterprise-grade onboarding management platform designed to automate and monitor employee onboarding processes.

The system utilizes a **rule-based orchestrator agent** to coordinate onboarding workflows, track progress in real time, and provide seamless collaboration between HR teams and managers.

---

# ✨ Key Features

## 🎯 Intelligent Orchestration

* Rule-based workflow coordination
* Sequential onboarding execution
* Automated task progression
* Failure detection and recovery

## 📊 Real-Time Progress Tracking

* Live onboarding dashboard
* Task status monitoring
* Progress percentage tracking
* Instant workflow visibility

## 👥 Dual Role Access

### HR Dashboard

* Add new employees
* Initiate onboarding
* Monitor progress
* Review onboarding history

### Manager Dashboard

* Track assigned tasks
* Retry failed activities
* Review employee status
* Access execution logs

## 🔄 Task Retry Management

* Retry failed onboarding tasks
* Error handling mechanisms
* Recovery workflow support

## 📜 Comprehensive Logging

* Activity tracking
* Audit trail maintenance
* Execution history storage
* Workflow transparency

## 🔐 Secure Authentication

* JWT-based authentication
* Role-based access control
* Protected API endpoints

