# 🗄️ Database Schema

## Employees

Stores employee onboarding information.

| Field  | Description         |
| ------ | ------------------- |
| id     | Employee Identifier |
| name   | Employee Name       |
| email  | Employee Email      |
| status | Onboarding Status   |

---

## Tasks

Tracks onboarding task execution.

| Field       | Description         |
| ----------- | ------------------- |
| id          | Task Identifier     |
| employee_id | Associated Employee |
| task_name   | Task Description    |
| status      | Execution Status    |

---

## Logs

Maintains complete activity history.

| Field     | Description      |
| --------- | ---------------- |
| id        | Log Identifier   |
| action    | Performed Action |
| timestamp | Event Time       |

---

## Users

Stores authentication credentials.

| Field         | Description        |
| ------------- | ------------------ |
| id            | User Identifier    |
| username      | Login Username     |
| role          | HR / Manager       |
| password_hash | Encrypted Password |

---

# ⚙️ Onboarding Workflow

The onboarding process consists of **8 sequential tasks** coordinated by the Orchestrator Agent.

```text
1. Employee Registration
        ↓
2. Document Collection
        ↓
3. Identity Verification
        ↓
4. IT Asset Allocation
        ↓
5. Email Account Creation
        ↓
6. System Access Provisioning
        ↓
7. Manager Approval
        ↓
8. Onboarding Completion
```

---

# 🚀 Installation

## Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/New-Hire-Onboarding-Concierge.git

cd New-Hire-Onboarding-Concierge
```

## Create Virtual Environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

### Windows

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

### Linux / macOS

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
```

## Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Run Backend

```bash
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

## Access Application

```text
Frontend:
http://localhost:8000

API Docs:
http://localhost:8000/docs
```

